    {
      "text": "They crush berries with their talons. They bravely stand up to any opponent, no matter how strong it is.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "They will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "They pick fights indiscriminately. They grow stronger and more powerful each time they faint or are injured.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its sharp claws, this Pokémon pierces its prey, and then it pecks at them. Although it also consumes berries, it’s a carnivore at heart.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its powerful legs and sturdy claws, it can crack even the hard shells of Shellder and pluck out their insides.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Known as a natural-born warrior, soon after its hatching, it will challenge its parent to a fight in order to gain their acceptance.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it spies a strong Pokémon, Rufflet can’t resist challenging it to a battle. But if Rufflet loses, it starts bawling.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "A combative Pokémon, it’s ready to pick a fight with anyone. It has talons that can crush hard berries.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its chick-like looks belie its hotheadedness. It challenges its parents at every opportunity, desperate to prove its strength.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
